{"Title":"An Act relative to creating a commercial driver’s license pilot program at Madison Park technical vocational high school","BillNumber":"S319","DocketNumber":"SD2303","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"L M0","Name":"Liz Miranda","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/L M0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T15:24:39.173"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"L M0","Name":"Liz Miranda","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/L M0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T15:24:39.1733333"},{"Id":"LME0","Name":"Lydia Edwards","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/LME0","ResponseDate":"2023-02-07T13:09:07.4666667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S319/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Ms. Miranda, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 319) of Liz Miranda and Lydia Edwards for legislation relative to create a commercial driver’s license pilot program at Madison Park technical vocational high school.  Education.","DocumentText":"\tChapter 74 of the General Laws is hereby amended by adding the following section: \r\n\tSection 59. (a) There is hereby established a pilot program known as the commercial driver’s license (CDL) program that shall be administered by Madison Park Technical Vocational High School in the city of Boston to provide training for transit driving. The program will provide classroom and off-site training. \r\n\t \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J14","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J14"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}